INT. ROOM 1 - DAY

People talk in room 1. Somebody laughs. The light is warm and the window is open to the street below.

MAYA
We should go soon. It is getting late, and nobody wants to be the last one here when the lights go out.

BOB
(checking his watch)
Five more minutes. I promise this time. Then we go.

They do not go. The conversation turns to old friends, old songs and the summer they all spent at the lake.

CUT TO:

